  "SNS": { abstractEn: "Azzalini Skew-Normal distribution as 3DGS primitive; learnable skewness for asymmetric boundary modeling [Abstract pending — contribution details to be added]", abstractCn: "Azzalini Skew-法线 distribution as 3DGS primitive; 可学习 skewness 用于 asymmetric boundary modeling。 [摘要待补充——贡献详情待添加]" },
  "Softmax-GS": { abstractEn: "Softmax-GS replaces the standard alpha-compositing equation in 3D Gaussian Splatting with a learnable softmax-based competition mechanism. This formulation allows Gaussians to competitively contribute to pixel colors, preventing multiple overlapping Gaussians from independently accumulating opacity and causing over-saturation artifacts. The softmax weighting provides a natural normalization that improves color accuracy in dense Gaussian regions. Experiments show improved PSNR and SSIM on standard benchmarks without additional computational overhead during rendering.", abstractCn: "Softmax-GS用可学习的基于softmax的竞争机制替代了3D高斯溅射中的标准alpha合成方程。该公式使高斯能够竞争性地贡献像素颜色，防止多个重叠高斯独立累积不透明度导致的过饱和伪影。softmax加权提供了自然的归一化，改善了密集高斯区域的颜色准确性。实验表明，在标准基准上PSNR和SSIM均有提升，且渲染阶段无额外计算开销。" },
