  "HiFi-SurfSplat": { abstractEn: "Compact polynomial kernel replacing IMLS + Laplacian stochastic regularization for high-freq geometry preservation [Abstract pending — contribution details to be added]", abstractCn: "紧凑 polynomial kernel 替代 IMLS + Laplacian stochastic 正则化 用于 high-freq geometry preservation。 [摘要待补充——贡献详情待添加]" },
