  "FlexiAvatar": { abstractEn: "FlexiAvatar is a unified avatar framework that optimizes only visible body regions using SMPL-X tracking and diffusion-based completion, enabling high-fidelity animatable human reconstruction from sparse views. ECCV 2026.", abstractCn: "FlexiAvatar是统一头像框架，利用SMPL-X追踪和扩散补全仅优化可见身体区域，从稀疏视角实现高保真可动画人体重建。ECCV 2026。" },
