  "PiG-Avatar": { abstractEn: "PiG-Avatar constructs hierarchical neural-field-guided Gaussian avatars in a volumetric canonical space that is decoupled from template topology, enabling high-fidelity avatar reconstruction and animation.", abstractCn: "PiG-Avatar在体素规范空间中构建层次化神经场引导的高斯头像，与模板拓扑解耦，实现高保真头像重建与动画。" },
