  "SplatPose": { abstractEn: "Pose-conditioned Gaussian Splatting for monocular human reconstruction [Abstract pending — contribution details to be added]", abstractCn: "Pose-conditioned Gaussian 溅射 用于 单目 human 重建。 [摘要待补充——贡献详情待添加]" },
