  "Visionary": { abstractEn: "Visionary is a WebGPU + ONNX Runtime 3DGS world model carrier platform, enabling real-time 4DGS, neural avatars, and generative post-processing directly in the browser for the first time.", abstractCn: "Visionary是基于WebGPU+ONNX Runtime的3DGS世界模型载体平台，首次在浏览器端实现4DGS、神经人像和生成式后处理的实时运行。" },
