  "Spark 2.0": { abstractEn: "Spark 2.0 is NVIDIA's 3DGS-based robotic world simulation platform, enabling real-time 3DGS reconstruction for manipulation learning and physical AI interaction via Gaussian environment modeling.", abstractCn: "Spark 2.0是英伟达基于3DGS的机器人世界仿真平台，通过高斯环境建模实现实时3DGS重建和物理AI交互。" },
